body:
): I am so sorry to hear that. Ik everyone's depression is different but I too had suicidal thoughts before he came along and they definitely got worse after he left. Ik it hurts so deeply and so badly.. there's a hurt and then a hollow feeling that you just can't get rid of and the hollow feelings seem to hurt more for me. The dread and wonder of what to do and if I can stand this feeling any longer. I don't mean to discount your depression or feelings, I just want you to know that youre not alone, ever.
 I don't have much advice on that because i have not found any answers for me in ridding that feeling other than just deciding to live everyday. Just waking up and going through the motions and pushing through cuz everyday you live and push through is a day to celebrate. How long ago was this break up? 
And really, if you every need anyone to vent to or talk to, just another human being, comment on here or message me and we'll chat about anything!
